---
description: whylog project rule
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository uses whylog as scaffold-only metadata. Do not add package manifests or lockfiles just to run it.
Before editing, inspect relevant context with `npx --yes --package whylog@0.4.0 whylog context <path>`.
Use `npx --yes --package whylog@0.4.0 whylog why <path:line>` for location-level decisions and `npx --yes --package whylog@0.4.0 whylog search <query>` when the path is unclear.
Avoid previously rejected approaches.
Commit with `npx --yes --package whylog@0.4.0 whylog commit -i` or `--from-json`.
Run `npx --yes --package whylog@0.4.0 whylog validate --range origin/main..HEAD --skip-unstructured --strict` before committing.
Never include secrets or internal-only details in trailers.
